{
  "id": "EnBdGTX3vZc",
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 1.27,
      "end": 4.84,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "- Best comic book adaptation... - Oh, yeah.",
          "start": 1.27,
          "end": 3.37
        },
        {
          "text": "- to film hand down. - It's--oh, yeah.",
          "start": 3.47,
          "end": 4.84
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "comic book adaptation",
          "ko": "만화 원작의 영화화",
          "type": "phrase"
        },
        {
          "term": "hands down",
          "ko": "단연코, 두말할 것 없이",
          "type": "idiom"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 4.94,
      "end": 6.94,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "- No argument. - Oh, yeah.",
          "start": 4.94,
          "end": 5.84
        },
        {
          "text": "Oh. See you later, girls.",
          "start": 5.94,
          "end": 6.94
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "no argument",
          "ko": "이견 없음, 반박 불가",
          "type": "idiom"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 7.04,
      "end": 13.31,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "- All right. - Oh, yeah.",
          "start": 7.04,
          "end": 8.44
        },
        {
          "text": "Um, I know I'm in the minority here, but I don't really like the Christopher Nolan Batman movies.",
          "start": 8.54,
          "end": 13.31
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "in the minority",
          "ko": "소수 의견인, 소수파인",
          "type": "idiom"
        },
        {
          "term": "overrated",
          "ko": "과대평가된",
          "type": "word"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 13.41,
      "end": 17.62,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "- [scoffs] - I don't.",
          "start": 13.41,
          "end": 14.51
        },
        {
          "text": "I really just feel like they're...overrated.",
          "start": 14.61,
          "end": 17.62
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 19.22,
      "end": 24.92,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Okay.",
          "start": 19.22,
          "end": 20.19
        },
        {
          "text": "Well, that's, um, that's just an opinion.",
          "start": 22.15,
          "end": 24.92
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 25.02,
      "end": 30.66,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "You see, that's why I prefaced it by saying, \"I know I'm in the minority.\"",
          "start": 25.02,
          "end": 29.56
        },
        {
          "text": "Awkward.",
          "start": 29.66,
          "end": 30.66
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "prefaced it by saying",
          "ko": "~라고 미리 운을 떼다, 서두를 달다",
          "type": "phrase"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 31.76,
      "end": 37.8,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "You know, what, no. No.",
          "start": 31.76,
          "end": 33.63
        },
        {
          "text": "Not really. It's not awkward, at least not until you said \"awkward.\"",
          "start": 33.73,
          "end": 37.8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 37.9,
      "end": 42.94,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Now it's awkward, because of what you said.",
          "start": 37.9,
          "end": 40.01
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyway.",
          "start": 41.71,
          "end": 42.94
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 43.04,
      "end": 53.62,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Anyway, what? Anyway, what?",
          "start": 43.04,
          "end": 44.64
        },
        {
          "text": "Really, 'cause when you say \"anyway,\" then you have to follow it up with an actual contribution to the conversation we're having.",
          "start": 44.74,
          "end": 53.62
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "follow it up with",
          "ko": "~로 뒤를 이어 말하다",
          "type": "phrase"
        },
        {
          "term": "contribution to the conversation",
          "ko": "대화에 보탬이 되는 말",
          "type": "phrase"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 53.72,
      "end": 56.72,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "- Yikes. - No, look at me.",
          "start": 53.72,
          "end": 54.85
        },
        {
          "text": "Look at me. Look at me. Look at me. Look at me.",
          "start": 54.95,
          "end": 56.72
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "yikes",
          "ko": "(구어) 헉, 이런 (민망·당황 표현)",
          "type": "word"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 56.82,
      "end": 63.8,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "There's no \"yikes,\" and the reason why there's no \"yikes\" is, there's nothing scary about this situation, okay?",
          "start": 56.82,
          "end": 61.96
        },
        {
          "text": "It's a very low-stakes situation.",
          "start": 62.06,
          "end": 63.8
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "low-stakes",
          "ko": "위험 부담이 적은, 별것 아닌",
          "type": "word"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 63.9,
      "end": 66.17,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "- All right.",
          "start": 63.9,
          "end": 64.8
        },
        {
          "text": "No, not \"all right.\" Come here. No.",
          "start": 64.9,
          "end": 66.17
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 66.27,
      "end": 69.1,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Don't look at him. Don't look at either of those guys.",
          "start": 66.27,
          "end": 67.53
        },
        {
          "text": "Look at me, all right?",
          "start": 67.63,
          "end": 69.1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 69.2,
      "end": 75.07,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "\"All right,\" what?",
          "start": 69.2,
          "end": 70.94
        },
        {
          "text": "'Cause after you say \"all right,\" you have to follow that up with something.",
          "start": 71.04,
          "end": 75.07
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 75.18,
      "end": 78.81,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Don't do it.",
          "start": 75.18,
          "end": 77.08
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't look at them.",
          "start": 77.18,
          "end": 78.81
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 78.91,
      "end": 82.21,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Do not look at them.",
          "start": 78.91,
          "end": 80.51
        },
        {
          "text": "No--No. Do not look at them.",
          "start": 80.61,
          "end": 82.21
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 82.32,
      "end": 84.55,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Do not look at them. Don't do it.",
          "start": 82.32,
          "end": 83.28
        },
        {
          "text": "Tell us how you really feel.",
          "start": 83.38,
          "end": 84.55
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 84.65,
      "end": 90.76,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Okay, you know what? I'll tell you how I really feel.",
          "start": 84.65,
          "end": 85.89
        },
        {
          "text": "Listen, I really feel like you're an asshole who has nothing interesting to say.",
          "start": 85.99,
          "end": 90.76
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "asshole",
          "ko": "(욕설) 재수 없는 놈",
          "type": "word"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 90.86,
      "end": 95.36,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "So what--oh. No. Don't.",
          "start": 90.86,
          "end": 93.29
        },
        {
          "text": "No, don't look at them. Turn your head.",
          "start": 93.39,
          "end": 95.36
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 95.46,
      "end": 100.4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Turn it. Right here.",
          "start": 95.46,
          "end": 97.2
        },
        {
          "text": "Tell me an opinion that you have about something.",
          "start": 97.3,
          "end": 100.4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 100.5,
      "end": 104.77,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Just one opinion that you have about anything at all.",
          "start": 100.5,
          "end": 102.9
        },
        {
          "text": "Just share an opinion. Anything. Share an opinion.",
          "start": 103,
          "end": 104.77
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 104.87,
      "end": 108.41,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Share an opinion. Share an opinion.",
          "start": 104.87,
          "end": 106.54
        },
        {
          "text": "Share an opinion right now. Just off the top of your head.",
          "start": 106.64,
          "end": 108.41
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "off the top of your head",
          "ko": "즉석에서, 생각나는 대로",
          "type": "idiom"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 108.51,
      "end": 111.68,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Share an opinion. Anything.",
          "start": 108.51,
          "end": 110.08
        },
        {
          "text": "Just one opinion, that's all I'm asking.",
          "start": 110.18,
          "end": 111.68
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 111.78,
      "end": 115.08,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Share one opinion right now.",
          "start": 111.78,
          "end": 113.18
        },
        {
          "text": "- Share it. Share an opinion. - Ah, ah, ah...",
          "start": 113.28,
          "end": 115.08
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 115.18,
      "end": 120.62,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I don't have an opinion, and that's why I just like everything that everyone else likes in pop culture.",
          "start": 115.18,
          "end": 120.62
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "pop culture",
          "ko": "대중문화",
          "type": "phrase"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 137.97,
      "end": 145.15,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Don't look at me.",
          "start": 137.97,
          "end": 140.04
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't look at me! Don't look at me!",
          "start": 140.14,
          "end": 145.15
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 156.22,
      "end": 157.22,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Okay.",
          "start": 156.22,
          "end": 157.22
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
